# Streamlit's multi-page navigation changes the URL (for example /explore).
# On a hard refresh, Stlite always boots into the app's default page, so send
# those refreshes back to the root instead of showing a Cloudflare 404.
#
# Do NOT use a catch-all such as `/* /index.html 200` or `/* / 302`:
# Cloudflare applies redirects even when a real file exists, which would
# replace app.py, requirements.txt, and pages/*.py with index.html.
#
# Add one line here for each page that gets a non-root URL path.
/explore     /    302
/article     /    302
/quiz        /    302
/progress    /    302
